Big Sur is our 1 -2 processor workstation always in a beige chassis. Weight
is ~ 60 lbs. It resembles a large PC.
The Lion server is always in a silver chassis. Sometimes rack mounted.
Weight is ~ 160 lbs.
Serial number stickers for Big Sur are always on the top of the chassis and
begin with ZBS.
Server serial stickers are always on the left side of the chassis and start
with ZLI.
 
